---
---

<section class="card about-card" id="about">
  <div class="card-header-row">
    <h2>
      <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="title-icon">
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
        <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
        <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"></line>
      </svg>
      Engineering Philosophy & Domains
    </h2>
    <span class="section-eyebrow">Architectural Principles</span>
  </div>

  <div class="lead-quote">
    <p>
      Autonomous software development with AI requires more than wider context windows.
      It demands <strong>epistemic discipline</strong>: strictly separating verified repository truth from transient agent memory, navigating codebases via structural AST graphs rather than noisy search, and deploying deterministic edge infrastructure that runs without friction.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="domains-grid">
    <div class="domain-box">
      <div class="domain-header">
        <span class="domain-tag">01 · Agent Epistemics</span>
        <h3>Dual-Brain Memory Systems</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="domain-desc">
        Coding agents routinely suffer from trust drift, conflating past speculative dialogue with ground truth. My architecture decouples repository truth (git history, ASTs, passing tests) from epistemic memory (causal facets, negative lessons, and trust decay).
      </p>
      <div class="domain-tech">
        <span>Veyra Engine</span>
        <span>Epistemic Ladder</span>
        <span>Causal Incident Learning</span>
        <span>Anti-Hallucination</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="domain-box">
      <div class="domain-header">
        <span class="domain-tag">02 · Code Intelligence</span>
        <h3>AST Graph Navigation</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="domain-desc">
        Shifting agent exploration from brute-force token-expensive regex/grep to structural call-graph traversal. Parsing symbols, inbound/outbound references, and hierarchical architecture to provide accurate blast-radius analysis within strict token budgets.
      </p>
      <div class="domain-tech">
        <span>Model Context Protocol (MCP)</span>
        <span>AST Call Graph</span>
        <span>Blast-Radius Analysis</span>
        <span>DeepSeek Harness</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="domain-box">
      <div class="domain-header">
        <span class="domain-tag">03 · Edge & Cloud</span>
        <h3>Resilient Systems & Tooling</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="domain-desc">
        Building high-availability serverless infrastructure and developer tooling. Designing dynamic multi-tier caches, multi-origin geo-steering load balancers on Cloudflare Workers, and native system daemon wrappers for FreeBSD.
      </p>
      <div class="domain-tech">
        <span>Cloudflare Workers</span>
        <span>Edge Geo-Steering</span>
        <span>Multi-Tier Caching</span>
        <span>FreeBSD & UNIX</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-card {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .title-icon {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .lead-quote {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .lead-quote p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .lead-quote strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .domains-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .domain-box {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .domain-box:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .domain-header {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .domain-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .domain-box h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .domain-desc {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .domain-tech {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .domain-tech span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--badge-text);
    background: var(--badge-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--badge-border);
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .domains-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
